    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alternative future, 2087. The world is recovering from a global flood.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Nikolaj, a man with no past, on his journey through the Valley of Life - a mountain oasis surrounded by barren wastelands. Guided by fate, he gets caught in clan wars for control over the local settlements. Find allies and take sides in the conflicts between raiders, smugglers, militarists, and techno-cultists!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And finally, uncover the role of a grim, impenetrable city in the north - a growing threat to all of humanity... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506540/extras/6691c59b964763b2acc14d3a79a8798c.avif?t=1752415639\" /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique visual atmosphere and post-flood setting,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An original storyline that changes depending on the decisions you make,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Varied pace of gameplay: the game combines quest, classic FPS and stealth-action episodes,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival simulator elements and challenging gameplay,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tons of additional quests, interesting characters and activities to keep you engaged.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506540/extras/d3f216eb4d783638781bb16e1e805ec4.avif?t=1752415639\" /></span>  </p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alternative future, 2087. The world is recovering from a global flood.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Nikolaj, a man with no past, on his journey through the Valley of Life - a mountain oasis surrounded by barren wastelands. Guided by fate, he gets caught in clan wars for control over the local settlements. Find allies and take sides in the conflicts between raiders, smugglers, militarists, and techno-cultists!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And finally, uncover the role of a grim, impenetrable city in the north - a growing threat to all of humanity... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506540/extras/6691c59b964763b2acc14d3a79a8798c.avif?t=1752415639\" /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique visual atmosphere and post-flood setting,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An original storyline that changes depending on the decisions you make,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Varied pace of gameplay: the game combines quest, classic FPS and stealth-action episodes,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival simulator elements and challenging gameplay,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tons of additional quests, interesting characters and activities to keep you engaged.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506540/extras/d3f216eb4d783638781bb16e1e805ec4.avif?t=1752415639\" /></span>  </p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Philosophical parable in the action\u2011adventure genre. Nikolaj finds himself in the Valley of Life \u2014 an oasis in the wasteland where clans wage a ruthless war for resources. Find allies and decide what matters most to you: helping people or profiting from their suffering?",
